    "faq": {
      "type": "faq",
      "blocks": {
        "166442457738b23caf-0": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Does it have smart features?",
            "content": "<p>All of our treadmills can connect to the <strong>WELLFIT App (free to use)</strong>, where you can track your workout data, set training plans, and even control the treadmill directly from your phone — including <strong>voice control</strong>.</p><p>You can also enjoy <strong>first-person scenic running</strong> through the app for a more immersive workout experience.</p><p>In addition, the treadmill syncs with <strong>Apple Health </strong>and supports <strong>Kinomap</strong> and <strong>Zwift</strong> for interactive training. It is also compatible with <strong>FitShow</strong>, <strong>WHOOP</strong>, and other apps that support the <strong>FTMS</strong> (Fitness Machine Service) protocol, ensuring broader connectivity with your favorite fitness platforms.<br/><br/>For safety, it includes a <strong>safety key</strong> — when detached, the machine stops immediately to prevent injury. The overall performance is also designed to run <strong>quietly</strong>, making it suitable for home use.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_DD4zAe": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Does the 30-day return cover all returns?",
            "content": "<p><strong>This return applies to quality-related issues only. </strong>If you are not satisfied with your purchase, return it within 30 days — WELLFIT will send you a <strong>pre-paid return label </strong>and <strong>cover the return shipping fee</strong>. Click <a href=\"https://wellfittreadmill.com/pages/refund-policy\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://wellfittreadmill.com/pages/refund-policy\"><strong>Refund Policy</strong></a> for more details.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_YG9FqX": {
          "type": "item",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "title": "🎁 Order Early for a Stress-Free Holiday (Christmas Tips)",
            "content": "<p>Buying early means your gift won’t arrive late — and even if the recipient prefers something else, you’ll still have time to switch to a perfect Plan B.<br/>Ordering now also helps you avoid holiday shipping delays and ensures your treadmill arrives well before Christmas.</p>"
          }
        },
        "166442457738b23caf-1": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "When my order ship and by which carrier?",
            "content": "<p>Your order will be delivered to your provided address within 1-5 working days from our 7 US warehouses in <strong>CA, NJ, GA, TX, Houston, and New York.</strong><br/>We use major shipping carriers such as FedEx Ground, UPS, and DHL for our deliveries.</p>"
          }
        },
        "166442457738b23caf-2": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Does the order need to pay for shipping & Tax?",
            "content": "<p>No, all orders are free shipping and tax-free. Consumers <strong>do not need to pay the 7%-15% sales tax.</strong></p>"
          }
        },
        "item_BUeUjn": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Do you ship to Puerto Rico or outside the United States?",
            "content": "<p>No, we only ship within the contiguous US 48 states, excluding Alaska, Hawaii, Puerto Rico....and also excluding any PO BOXES (sorry, but we can't ship our items to any PO BOX, period). </p><p>in addition to shipping across the United States, we also ship to <a href=\"https://eu.wellfittreadmill.com/\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://eu.wellfittreadmill.com/\"><strong>Europe</strong></a> and the <a href=\"https://uk.wellfittreadmill.com/\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://uk.wellfittreadmill.com/\"><strong>United Kingdom</strong></a>. </p><p>For <a href=\"https://eu.wellfittreadmill.com/\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://eu.wellfittreadmill.com/\"><strong>European</strong></a><strong> orders</strong>, we ship from our warehouse in <strong>Duisburg, Germany (47138)</strong>. We currently deliver to Germany and other European countries, including <strong>Croatia, Denmark, Estonia, Finland, France, Greece, Italy, Netherlands, Portugal, Spain, and Sweden</strong>. Orders are shipped via DPD and DHL.</p><p>For <a href=\"https://uk.wellfittreadmill.com/\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://uk.wellfittreadmill.com/\"><strong>UK orders</strong></a>, we operate warehouses in <strong>Tamworth, England (B78 2FG)</strong> and <strong>Walsall, West Midlands (WS8 7DG)</strong>. Orders are shipped via Evri, Yodel, and FedEx.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_MWyNaN": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Can it be used on carpet/wood/tile?",
            "content": "<p>Yes, it be used on carpet/wood/tile</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_pJy8dw": {
          "type": "item",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "title": "Question",
            "content": "<p>Write content to answer to common questions your customers may have about your products, shipping policies..</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_BxcYWU": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Do I need to pay when using wellfit app?",
            "content": "<p>No, you can enjoy our wellfit app for lifetime free and its vast training courses.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
